        "Small businesses, real results",
        "\"Our old site hadn't been touched in four years. Doman rebuilt it, and now when I need the menu changed I just email them — done the same day. Bookings are up noticeably since launch.\"",
        "\"I looked at a few web companies and everyone else wanted £3,000 upfront. Doman's monthly plan meant we could get a proper site without draining the bank account before we'd even opened.\"",
